# The Kotlin half of the core's Android certificate checks (rustls-platform-verifier),
# from the project's own Maven branch, one line per file at the version core/Cargo.lock
# has (rustls-platform-verifier-android). tools/android-core.sh refuses anything else;
# when Cargo.lock moves to a new version, check the new files and add their lines.
